rade cards to use to upgrade gunboats or jump your troops. The troops include various options such as armored vehicles, tanks, helicopters, rocket launchers, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to protect the base car located in the center. If the base car's health drops to zero, the game ends. As time goes by, the enemies will become more and stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343560/extras/8bc2f4744523cf1246d6cf1fbb996f64.poster.avif?t=1745032723\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343560/extras/8bc2f4744523cf1246d6cf1fbb996f64.webm?t=1745032723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343560/extras/8bc2f4744523cf1246d6cf1fbb996f64.mp4?t=1745032723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featured Introduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of monsters coexist simultaneously</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful super weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joyful shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handsome missile salvo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No in-game purchases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added online mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, players will color the field</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343560/extras/5c4f86c34409b346ffbf5bac039830f0.poster.avif?t=1745032723\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343560/extras/5c4f86c34409b346ffbf5bac039830f0.webm?t=1745032723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai